"history tracking policies. Current values for each record for each policy "
"are cached to speed browses and display. For records with values having "
"future dates, current values will change as those future dates become "
"present dates. This command will update the cached current values to reflect "
"the transition from future to current. It should be run periodically (at "
"least once a day) to ensure the accuracy of the current value cache."
msgstr ""
"CollectiveAccess supports tracking of location and use histories through "
"history tracking policies. Current values for each record for each policy "
"are cached to speed browses and display. For records with values having "
"future dates, current values will change as those future dates become "
"present dates. This command will update the cached current values to reflect "
"the transition from future to current. It should be run periodically (at "
"least once a day) to ensure the accuracy of the current value cache."

