#: app/models/ca_metadata_type_restrictions.php:231
msgid ""
"If set to 0 a delete button will allow a cataloguer to quickly clear the "
"data contents of the element by collapsing the placement on the user "
"interface screen.  If set to 1, the element will be fixed in place and data "
"will need to be deleted manually.  If set to more than 1, the element "
